{"id": "47f6a9b9-1dec-4a07-8daa-e1b9236b618d", "slug": "technical-brand-geometry-1", "title": "Technical Brand Geometry", "description": "Technical Brand Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Technical Brand Geometry\"\ndescription: \"Technical Brand Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#000000\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#000000\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#8A8A93\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#8A8A93\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Technical Brand Geometry\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 689; favorites: 39; remixes: 20.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, effect.\n## Overview\nTechnical Brand Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nCore Framework Quantum Grid* 78px 68px 98px 240px 48px DEVELOPED BY NEXUS .LABS\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #000000, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #000000, background #000000, surface #8A8A93, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Technical Brand Geometry</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r134/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap');\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #EFEFF5;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Skeuomorphic Gradient Overlay + Subtle Diagonal Grid Overlay */\n        .bg-blueprint {\n            background-image:\n                /* Soft vertical highlight simulating light from above */\n                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%),\n                /* Blueprint Diagonal Grid */\n                linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0.02)),\n                linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0.02));\n            background-size: 100% 100%, 20px 20px, 20px 20px;\n            background-position: 0 0, 0 0, 10px 10px;\n        }\n\n        /* Skeuomorphic Gradient Border Treatment */\n        .gradient-border-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #EFEFF5;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n        .gradient-border-wrapper::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            padding: 1px;\n            /* Simulates a physical edge with a top highlight and bottom shadow */\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,1) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 100%);\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n\n        /* Embossed text shadow for premium tactile feel */\n        .text-embossed {\n            text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n        }\n\n        /* SVG Inner Geometry Drop Shadow */\n        .svg-drop-shadow {\n            filter: drop-shadow(0px 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)) drop-shadow(0px 6px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.04));\n        }\n\n        /* L-Shaped Corner Brackets - Moved inward to sit inside the rounded corners */\n        .corner-bracket {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 16px;\n            height: 16px;\n            border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .corner-tl { top: 20px; left: 20px; border-top: 1px solid; border-left: 1px solid; }\n        .corner-tr { top: 20px; right: 20px; border-top: 1px solid; border-right: 1px solid; }\n        .corner-bl { bottom: 20px; left: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid; border-left: 1px solid; }\n        .corner-br { bottom: 20px; right: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid; border-right: 1px solid; }\n\n        /* Masked Reveal Setup */\n        .reveal-mask {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: inline-block;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        .reveal-text {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(100%);\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n\n        /* SVG Specific Styling */\n        .svg-stroke {\n            stroke: #8A8A93;\n            stroke-width: 0.5;\n            fill: none;\n            vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\n        }\n        .svg-stroke-dashed {\n            stroke: #8A8A93;\n            stroke-width: 0.5;\n            stroke-dasharray: 4 4;\n            fill: none;\n            vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\n        }\n        .svg-fill-light {\n            fill: #E5E5EB;\n            stroke: #8A8A93;\n            stroke-width: 0.5;\n        }\n        .svg-fill-dark {\n            fill: #D1D1D4;\n        }\n        .svg-text {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 8px;\n            fill: #111;\n            font-weight: 400; /* Font weight reduced as requested */\n        }\n        .svg-dimension-line {\n            stroke: #8A8A93;\n            stroke-width: 0.5;\n        }\n        .svg-tick {\n            stroke: #8A8A93;\n            stroke-width: 0.5;\n        }\n\n        #webgl-container {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            opacity: 0.4;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-slate-900 antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center items-center selection:bg-slate-200\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-container\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Layout Grid lines extending outside frame -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center items-center opacity-20\">\n        <div class=\"h-full w-px bg-slate-400 absolute left-1/3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"h-full w-px bg-slate-400 absolute right-1/3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-slate-400 absolute top-1/2\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Frame -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[90vw] lg:max-w-4xl aspect-[4/5] lg:aspect-video flex items-center justify-center p-4 lg:p-8\">\n\n        <!-- Framed Area with Skeuomorphic Details & Beautiful Large Shadow -->\n        <div class=\"gradient-border-wrapper w-full h-full relative flex items-center justify-center bg-blueprint rounded-3xl shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)] after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:pointer-events-none after:shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,1),inset_0_-1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.005]\">\n\n            <!-- Inset Corner Brackets for structural aesthetic -->\n            <div class=\"corner-bracket corner-tl\"></div>\n            <div class=\"corner-bracket corner-tr\"></div>\n            <div class=\"corner-bracket corner-bl\"></div>\n            <div class=\"corner-bracket corner-br\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Internal Grid Guides -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-10 rounded-[inherit] overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-[30%] border-l border-slate-900\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-[30%] border-r border-slate-900\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 top-[40%] border-t border-slate-900\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Left Metadata -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-8 flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                <div class=\"reveal-mask\">\n                    <span class=\"reveal-text text-xs tracking-tight font-normal text-slate-800 text-embossed uppercase\">Core Framework</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reveal-mask\">\n                    <span class=\"reveal-text text-xs tracking-tight text-slate-500 uppercase\">Quantum Grid*</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Center Geometric Diagram (The 'N') -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-[80%] max-w-[500px] aspect-square flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"-250 -250 500 500\" class=\"w-full h-full overflow-visible\" id=\"geometry-svg\">\n                    <!-- Long diagonal background lines -->\n                    <line x1=\"-400\" y1=\"-300\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"400\" class=\"svg-stroke opacity-30\" />\n                    <line x1=\"-350\" y1=\"-350\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"400\" class=\"svg-stroke opacity-30\" />\n                    <line x1=\"-200\" y1=\"-350\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"250\" class=\"svg-stroke opacity-30\" />\n\n                    <line x1=\"-300\" y1=\"-100\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"300\" class=\"svg-stroke opacity-30\" />\n                    <line x1=\"-100\" y1=\"-300\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"100\" class=\"svg-stroke opacity-30\" />\n\n                    <!-- Base Grid within the shape area -->\n                    <g class=\"svg-stroke opacity-20\">\n                        <line x1=\"-120\" y1=\"-50\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"-50\" />\n                        <line x1=\"-120\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"50\" />\n                        <line x1=\"-50\" y1=\"-120\" x2=\"-50\" y2=\"120\" />\n                        <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"-120\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"120\" />\n                    </g>\n\n                    <!-- The Geometric 'N' Shape Construction (with drop shadow for lift) -->\n                    <g id=\"main-shape\" class=\"svg-drop-shadow\">\n                        <!-- Center Vertical Column -->\n                        <rect x=\"-24\" y=\"-120\" width=\"48\" height=\"240\" class=\"svg-fill-light\" />\n\n                        <!-- Left Diagonal Wing -->\n                        <polygon points=\"-120,-20 -120,60 -24,120 -24,-20\" class=\"svg-fill-light\" />\n\n                        <!-- Right Diagonal Wing -->\n                        <polygon points=\"24,-120 24,20 120,-40 120,-120\" class=\"svg-fill-light\" />\n\n                        <!-- Left Inner Square (Dark - acts as a carved inset visually) -->\n                        <rect x=\"-110\" y=\"-10\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"svg-fill-dark svg-stroke\" />\n\n                        <!-- Right Inner Square (Dark - acts as a carved inset visually) -->\n                        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"-40\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"svg-fill-dark svg-stroke\" />\n\n                        <!-- Internal grid lines of the shape -->\n                        <line x1=\"-120\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"-24\" y2=\"20\" class=\"svg-stroke opacity-40\" />\n                        <line x1=\"-72\" y1=\"-20\" x2=\"-72\" y2=\"90\" class=\"svg-stroke opacity-40\" />\n\n                        <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"-40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"-40\" class=\"svg-stroke opacity-40\" />\n                        <line x1=\"72\" y1=\"-120\" x2=\"72\" y2=\"0\" class=\"svg-stroke opacity-40\" />\n                    </g>\n\n                    <!-- Dimension Lines and Text -->\n                    <g class=\"dimensions\">\n                        <!-- Top right 78px -->\n                        <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"-140\" x2=\"102\" y2=\"-140\" class=\"svg-dimension-line\" />\n                        <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"-143\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"-137\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <line x1=\"102\" y1=\"-143\" x2=\"102\" y2=\"-137\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <text x=\"63\" y=\"-145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"svg-text\">78px</text>\n                        <line x1=\"102\" y1=\"-140\" x2=\"102\" y2=\"-120\" class=\"svg-stroke-dashed\" />\n\n                        <!-- Bottom left 68px -->\n                        <line x1=\"-120\" y1=\"-40\" x2=\"-52\" y2=\"-40\" class=\"svg-dimension-line\" />\n                        <line x1=\"-120\" y1=\"-43\" x2=\"-120\" y2=\"-37\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <line x1=\"-52\" y1=\"-43\" x2=\"-52\" y2=\"-37\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <text x=\"-86\" y=\"-45\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"svg-text\">68px</text>\n                        <line x1=\"-120\" y1=\"-40\" x2=\"-120\" y2=\"-20\" class=\"svg-stroke-dashed\" />\n\n                        <!-- Bottom right 98px -->\n                        <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"122\" y2=\"140\" class=\"svg-dimension-line\" />\n                        <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"143\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <line x1=\"122\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"122\" y2=\"143\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <text x=\"73\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"svg-text\">98px</text>\n                        <line x1=\"122\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"122\" y2=\"-40\" class=\"svg-stroke-dashed\" />\n\n                        <!-- Center vertical 240px -->\n                        <line x1=\"-40\" y1=\"-120\" x2=\"-40\" y2=\"120\" class=\"svg-dimension-line\" />\n                        <line x1=\"-43\" y1=\"-120\" x2=\"-37\" y2=\"-120\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <line x1=\"-43\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"-37\" y2=\"120\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <text x=\"-45\" y=\"0\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"svg-text\" transform=\"rotate(-90, -45, 0)\">240px</text>\n\n                        <!-- Center horizontal 48px -->\n                        <line x1=\"-24\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"160\" class=\"svg-dimension-line\" />\n                        <line x1=\"-24\" y1=\"157\" x2=\"-24\" y2=\"163\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"157\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"163\" class=\"svg-tick\" />\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"svg-text\">48px</text>\n                    </g>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Right Metadata -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 flex flex-col items-end gap-0.5 text-right\">\n                <div class=\"reveal-mask\">\n                    <span class=\"reveal-text text-xs tracking-tight font-normal text-slate-800 text-embossed\">DEVELOPED</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reveal-mask flex items-center gap-1\">\n                    <span class=\"reveal-text text-xs tracking-tight text-slate-500\">BY</span>\n                    <span class=\"reveal-text text-xs tracking-tight font-normal text-slate-800 text-embossed\">NEXUS<span class=\"text-xs align-top\">.LABS</span></span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Background Animation (Subtle Grid) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Fog to fade out edges smoothly\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0xEFEFF5, 0.0015);\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 200;\n            camera.position.y = 50;\n            camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Create a custom grid of lines that moves slowly\n            const material = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x8A8A93,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.15\n            });\n\n            const points = [];\n            const size = 1000;\n            const step = 40;\n\n            for (let i = -size; i <= size; i += step) {\n                // Diagonal lines direction 1\n                points.push(new THREE.Vector3(-size, 0, i));\n                points.push(new THREE.Vector3(size, 0, i + size));\n\n                // Diagonal lines direction 2\n                points.push(new THREE.Vector3(i, 0, -size));\n                points.push(new THREE.Vector3(i + size, 0, size));\n            }\n\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(points);\n            const grid = new THREE.LineSegments(geometry, material);\n\n            // Tilt grid to match 2D diagonal aesthetic somewhat\n            grid.rotation.x = Math.PI / 4;\n            scene.add(grid);\n\n            let time = 0;\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                time += 0.001;\n\n                // Extremely slow, subtle panning to give life without distraction\n                grid.position.x = Math.sin(time) * 10;\n                grid.position.z = (time * 10) % step; // infinite scroll effect\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Masked Text Reveal\n            const revealTexts = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text');\n            gsap.to(revealTexts, {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 0.8,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // SVG Drawing Animation\n            const svgPaths = document.querySelectorAll('#geometry-svg polygon, #geometry-svg rect, #geometry-svg line.svg-dimension-line, #geometry-svg line.svg-stroke-dashed');\n\n            // Set initial state for SVG elements to create drawing effect\n            gsap.set(svgPaths, { opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set('.svg-fill-light, .svg-fill-dark', { fillOpacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set('.svg-text, .svg-tick', { opacity: 0 });\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ delay: 0.5 });\n\n            // Fade in paths and geometry outlines\n            tl.to(svgPaths, {\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.5,\n                stagger: 0.02,\n                ease: \"power2.inOut\"\n            })\n            // Fade in fills\n            .to('.svg-fill-light, .svg-fill-dark', {\n                fillOpacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                ease: \"power2.out\"\n            }, \"-=0.2\")\n            // Reveal text and ticks last\n            .to('.svg-text, .svg-tick', {\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.4,\n                ease: \"power1.inOut\"\n            }, \"-=0.4\");\n\n            // Subtle hover effect on the entire diagram\n            const svgContainer = document.getElementById('geometry-svg');\n            svgContainer.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n                gsap.to(svgContainer, { scale: 1.02, duration: 0.4, ease: \"power2.out\" });\n            });\n            svgContainer.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                gsap.to(svgContainer, { scale: 1, duration: 0.4, ease: \"power2.out\" });\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize on load\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initGSAP();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "technical-brand-geometry-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/technical-brand-geometry-1.jpg", "source_name": "technical-brand-geometry-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 1030, "forks": 35, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T22:54:31.421895+00:00"}